WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.400
Today we will shape a useful object from malleable material. Our work connects with

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:06.515
communities across Africa.

00:00:07.367 --> 00:00:09.649
Roll a smooth ball of soft material.

00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:15.207
Press a thumb gently into the centre and pinch the sides evenly.

00:00:16.033 --> 00:00:21.168
Smooth the rim and show how the finished bowl can stand. Explain one respectful

00:00:21.168 --> 00:00:23.735
similarity or difference with another African example.
